      },
      "lineNbr": 404,
      "author": {
        "id": 1884477
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-07T15:00:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think that advertising sets are intended to be discarded after one use, and not to be recycled for a different purpose.\n\nThe same issue would occur with advertising data anyway: switching from an advertising type with advertising data to another one without, you have to manually clear the advertising data.",
      "parentUuid": "f3887672_b466e075",
      "range": {
